WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
TSAAT brings recorded cyber terrain evidence into a clearer view.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Explore recorded devices, installed software, vulnerability observations and their relationships.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Use Governance for summaries and Discovery to examine the records behind them.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Use the evidence to ask better questions, investigate gaps and explain what you find.
